Package: rMosaic
Type: Package
Title: "Mosaic Shiny Integration"
Version: 0.1.1
Description: "Embed the Mosaic framework in R, allowing users to declaratively define visualizations (via JSON/YAML specs) and render interactive Mosaic plots in Shiny. Data queries are executed in DuckDB via R, enabling scalable linked visuals."
License: BSD-3-Clause
Imports:
    htmlwidgets (>= 1.5.4),
    shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    jsonlite,
    yaml,
    DBI,
    duckdb,
    arrow
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/TiRizvanov/rMosaic
BugReports: https://github.com/TiRizvanov/rMosaic/issues
